MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add a 素材库 button to every image node (with or without url). Clicking
it opens the Plan 2 imageAssetPickerModal — a focused picker (image grid
+ search + close) with no asset-library management chrome. Clicking a
thumb dispatches the image-picker:apply event that canvas.js already
handles via setImageNodeFromOutput.

- renderNode: emits data-image-library-open / data-blank-image-library-open
  buttons styled like the existing prompt-template-btn.
- Both handlers route through openImageAssetPicker(node.id).
- canvas.css: .image-caption-row keeps the name + button on one line.

Tests: tests/test_image_node_library_button.mjs (5/5 pass); full jsdom
suite 57/57 pass; python 55/55 pass.

Co-Authored-By: claude-sonnet-4-6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
